 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A showman marched 21 elephants across the Brooklyn Bridge to test it.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.647
  },
  {
   "text": "Leading them: Jumbo, six tons, on a bridge everyone feared would collapse.",
   "s": 3.947,
   "e": 7.393
  },
  {
   "text": "Why elephants? Everyone said they never step on anything wobbly.",
   "s": 7.692,
   "e": 10.821
  },
  {
   "text": "So the herd lined up trunk to tail, the showman out front.",
   "s": 11.121,
   "e": 13.673
  },
  {
   "text": "But halfway across, the cables started to hum.",
   "s": 13.973,
   "e": 15.869
  },
  {
   "text": "Thousands on the riverbanks froze. Would it hold?",
   "s": 16.169,
   "e": 18.289
  },
  {
   "text": "Jumbo stopped, looked down, and lifted one giant foot.",
   "s": 19.059,
   "e": 21.604
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he stomped. Nothing moved.",
   "s": 21.904,
   "e": 23.356
  },
  {
   "text": "So the bridge passed, and the showman got a week of free ads.",
   "s": 23.656,
   "e": 26.263
  },
  {
   "text": "That's how you safety-test a bridge: elephants.",
   "s": 26.563,
   "e": 28.632
  }
 ],
